    dct:description "Thermodynamic data and simulations are abundant, and specific derived predictions can be tested. The broad claim of resolving the conceptual basis of the Second Law is not discriminated merely by reproducing familiar macroscopic behavior." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Formalize the proposed simple-program account of entropy increase and derive predictions for relaxation, recurrence, and entropy production in specified systems. Compare these against existing statistical-mechanics simulations and experimental time series and against standard rival accounts." ;
